Corrected message:

Let S reach the selection tools when no shape point is selected

With a shape tool active, S and D were reported as handled even with
no point to act on, so S never reached the toolbox and Select, Lasso
Select and Magic Wand could not be picked by shortcut. S/D now consume
the key only when a point is selected.

Also:
- S/D on a selected point outside a drag adds its own undo step;
  before, the change was lost on the next undo. Pressing it on a point
  that already has that tension adds no step.
- Clicking on the curve after S/D hits the curve's new shape instead
  of its old one.
- Tooltips say S/D act on the selected point, not "while dragging".
- Add end-to-end key dispatch tests.
